 obtain ⟨Y,T,h,v,Z⟩:= PostHeightRankNX p B0 M pu A D Q t u' H m U S V P' hm B
 exact ΓPlateSnapNX p m hm B F _ HV (fixedForceR p B0 M pu A D three S V F HV.1) Y T h v Z -- tune order
